        },
        {
          "text": "Kiira ecen loka Paul nuka aperunikec; kolot koloma ore loka iserikalei, kolimok Paul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyarau Paul ekapolokiton ediopet kotemaatiar, “Koyaŋa etelepat lo mama ejai ekapolon; naarai ejai akirot naelimokini ŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuka ŋun koyaŋa ŋes, kitoloma neejai ekapolon, kobala ebe, “Abu Paul ŋol eenat kanyara eoŋ, kelip aitolomun etelepat lo mamakon, naarai ejai akirot naineras kajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiŋ ekapolon akekan kogitaros kaŋes, kiŋit kaiyeiyea ebe, “Anyoin akirot naikoto ijo alimokin eoŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala ebe, “Enerut Iyudayan aiŋitun jo aitodokar Paul moi toma aurianet, bala ekotos aiŋitiŋit kotenan akekiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso siri jo kicam; naarai eperunito ŋes ituŋa luedeparito akaisaoŋon kakesi, luaenikinos kaiyaposit ebe mam enyamete karaida aimat kiton neaariata ŋes; aso kwana ekapakina kesi, idaretos akoniisumunet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kotwar ekapolon etelepat, kicoro ebe, “Sirikilimok idiotuŋanan ebe kikwenyarit eoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
